This pipeline orchestrates external tools via their command-line interfaces:
  - art_modern (GNU GPL v3)
  - scDesign2 (check its repository license)
  - RSEM, samtools (their own licenses)
  - biomaRt and other R/Bioconductor packages (their own licenses)

Calling GPL tools as separate processes over a CLI does not by itself impose GPL
on this workflow's own scripts, but confirm with your institution. Choose and
insert the full license text here before making the repository public. A
permissive license (MIT / BSD-3-Clause) is common for workflow code; GPL-3.0 is
also reasonable given the art_modern dependency.

